item: u3-l4-choice-geiger

card c10
kind: teach
type: explain
scored: 0
title: Three instruments
figure: instruments-row
figure_at: 1

body:
    A Geiger counter detects ionization in a gas. A scintillation counter turns flashes of light into a signal. A dosimeter is worn by a person to measure how much radiation they are exposed to.

